+## Failure signature reproduction
+
+A failing offline stage emits a `KOGEN_FAILURE_SIGNATURE` frame. Its optional `reproduce` field records the complete stage command with the stage environment, such as `MIX_ENV=test mix test --exclude live --warnings-as-errors` or `MIX_ENV=dev mix compile --warnings-as-errors --force`. Signature-frame replay omits this field; the reproduction command is guidance for the controller handoff and is not included in the signature digest.
